01:59:42.240 --> 01:59:43.227
I remember the first time-

01:59:43.227 --> 01:59:45.460
- No, what's worst is
when I can actually feel

01:59:45.460 --> 01:59:47.460
like something underneath-
- You kick something.

01:59:47.460 --> 01:59:48.293
- Yeah, you kick something.

01:59:48.293 --> 01:59:49.310
That's when I'm scared.

01:59:49.310 --> 01:59:50.850
- Yeah, I mean like if, I don't know,

01:59:50.850 --> 01:59:52.353
something like in a pool, completely fine.

01:59:52.353 --> 01:59:55.130
I don't give a if I can't feel the bottom.

01:59:55.130 --> 01:59:56.680
I remember the first time I realized it

01:59:56.680 --> 01:59:58.280
when we were on the beach.

01:59:58.280 --> 01:59:59.750
It was Brighton Beach's work.

01:59:59.750 --> 02:00:02.850
So it wasn't exactly a
fucking thrilling beach.

02:00:02.850 --> 02:00:04.480
And I remember like my mates just,

02:00:04.480 --> 02:00:07.027
though, we were kinda just
like, oh yeah, let's go swim out

02:00:07.027 --> 02:00:09.860
