02:00:16.537 --> 02:00:18.940
that I had swam that far out.

02:00:18.940 --> 02:00:20.250
And this is the first time in my life

02:00:20.250 --> 02:00:24.400
where I got to this point
and I started kicking down

02:00:24.400 --> 02:00:27.250
and my whole life experience had taught me

02:00:27.250 --> 02:00:29.879
no matter how deep it is,
you can still stand up.

02:00:29.879 --> 02:00:30.717
- Yeah.

02:00:30.717 --> 02:00:33.114
(laughing)

02:00:33.114 --> 02:00:36.367
- And so it was this
realization where we get there

02:00:36.367 --> 02:00:38.910
and we start floating on
the water and I'm just like,

02:00:38.910 --> 02:00:39.810
where's the floor?

02:00:41.930 --> 02:00:42.763
Where's the ocean floor?
- This is what happens

02:00:42.763 --> 02:00:44.210
when you're six foot.

02:00:44.210 --> 02:00:45.390
You take floor for granted.

02:00:45.390 --> 02:00:46.973
- Yeah, exactly, right?

02:00:46.973 --> 02:00:48.540
I never had a swimming pool

02:00:48.540 --> 02:00:51.060
where I couldn't like stand up
at least on like my tiptoes.

02:00:51.060 --> 02:00:54.230
I sink down a little bit
and then I can still see

02:00:54.230 --> 02:00:56.210
the surface of the water,
I'm still on my tip toes.

02:00:56.210 --> 02:00:58.110
I can reach the surface quite easily.

02:00:58.110 --> 02:01:01.500
So this was the first time
where I'd gone this far out

02:01:01.500 --> 02:01:04.410
and I had the realization of, oh, okay.

02:01:04.410 --> 02:01:08.160
There is no edges to this pool
that I can quickly grab onto.

02:01:08.160 --> 02:01:10.830
I've gotta swim literally
like all the way back

02:01:10.830 --> 02:01:12.467
to the fucking beach.

02:01:12.467 --> 02:01:15.700
And the beach, like, you
know, that scene in the movies

02:01:15.700 --> 02:01:17.840
where the character gets vertigo,

02:01:17.840 --> 02:01:20.370
where they look down and
the ground just suddenly

02:01:20.370 --> 02:01:23.400
like zooms out, that's exactly how I look.

02:01:23.400 --> 02:01:24.780
That's exactly what the beach looked like

02:01:24.780 --> 02:01:26.010
when I turned around and it's just like

02:01:26.010 --> 02:01:29.120
the beach just went, like that.

02:01:29.120 --> 02:01:30.910
And I was just like, oh shit.

02:01:30.910 --> 02:01:33.190
