02:02:45.234 --> 02:02:46.525
- (laughs) Like a nice beach.

02:02:46.525 --> 02:02:47.840
- Yeah. (laughs)

02:02:47.840 --> 02:02:48.701
- Come to Wales, man.

02:02:48.701 --> 02:02:49.534
We've got the finest beaches.

02:02:49.534 --> 02:02:51.640
We've got the finest beaches, man.

02:02:51.640 --> 02:02:54.370
- My fondest memory as
a kid, 'cause Australia,

02:02:54.370 --> 02:02:56.040
every fucking house has like a pool in it

02:02:56.040 --> 02:02:57.411
'cause otherwise you can't survive

02:02:57.411 --> 02:02:58.307
the (indistinct) summer.
- Full luxury.

02:02:58.307 --> 02:03:00.220
- You can't survive the summer otherwise.

02:03:00.220 --> 02:03:01.630
But my fondest memory,

02:03:01.630 --> 02:03:04.120
