have learned how to swim.

02:04:22.180 --> 02:04:24.640
I don't know where I would've
gotten the motivation

02:04:24.640 --> 02:04:27.220
to be like, okay, I'm going
to go out and figure out

02:04:27.220 --> 02:04:30.250
