play through water.

02:04:30.250 --> 02:04:31.852
- Pool's everywhere in the UK.

02:04:31.852 --> 02:04:33.550
(indistinct) in the public.
- Yeah. Exactly.

02:04:33.550 --> 02:04:35.367
