pieces of in your pool?

02:04:50.544 --> 02:04:51.377
(laughs)

02:04:51.377 --> 02:04:52.520
- Yeah, it happened like

02:04:53.532 --> 02:04:55.283
in a year.
- It happens.

02:04:55.283 --> 02:04:56.420
- It's like code brown.

02:04:56.420 --> 02:04:57.400
So it was like-

02:04:57.400 --> 02:04:59.810
- Code brown.
- That's what it was.

02:04:59.810 --> 02:05:00.643
You have to empty...

02:05:00.643 --> 02:05:02.580
