and it would clean it,

02:05:42.027 --> 02:05:44.620
but the water is like never like emptied.

02:05:44.620 --> 02:05:47.523
It's just like recycled, right.

02:05:47.523 --> 02:05:51.359
And you gotta do a chlorine
test every like two hours,

02:05:51.359 --> 02:05:52.840
