02:05:52.840 --> 02:05:54.840
But I never did that, I wasn't allowed to.

02:05:54.840 --> 02:05:56.169
They were like, "We don't
trust you with chlorine."

02:05:56.169 --> 02:05:57.823
- (laughs) We don't
trust you with chemicals.

02:05:57.823 --> 02:05:59.200
- "We don't trust yo with
the chlorine, Connor.

02:05:59.200 --> 02:06:00.033
Get outta here."

02:06:00.033 --> 02:06:03.430
I was never like a manager
there, so I was just like that.

02:06:03.430 --> 02:06:06.150
- I remember still having
like fucking vivid memories

02:06:06.150 --> 02:06:07.353
