twice, I think, to me.

02:06:12.900 --> 02:06:15.590
- Yeah, 'cause like we would never float.

02:06:15.590 --> 02:06:17.667
You would always be at the bottom.

02:06:17.667 --> 02:06:20.620
And like as a kid, I was just like you,

02:06:20.620 --> 02:06:22.200
'cause I was always been shortsighted.

02:06:22.200 --> 02:06:24.340
I was always shortsighted my entire life.

02:06:24.340 --> 02:06:27.560
And I didn't know this until
I was like maybe 10 years old

02:06:27.560 --> 02:06:29.792
