02:06:29.792 --> 02:06:31.280
Oh my God.

02:06:31.280 --> 02:06:33.853
Actually, I remember. (laughs)

02:06:35.120 --> 02:06:38.700
I remember as a kid, I would
be sitting really close

02:06:38.700 --> 02:06:41.670
