- The audience will fight.

02:07:05.670 --> 02:07:08.910
- I was just born with bad
eyesight unfortunately.

02:07:08.910 --> 02:07:11.890
So as a kid, I didn't
have glasses at the time,

02:07:11.890 --> 02:07:13.440
so I would be swimming in the pool

02:07:13.440 --> 02:07:15.480
and I would see this like little,

02:07:15.480 --> 02:07:18.090
I remember seeing this like
little black fucking thing,

02:07:18.090 --> 02:07:19.780
like in the corner of this pool, right?

02:07:19.780 --> 02:07:21.250
- What did you do?

02:07:21.250 --> 02:07:22.710
- And it was fucking
blurry as fuck, right?

02:07:22.710 --> 02:07:26.940
I'm just like, what the is
this black thing in the corner.

02:07:26.940 --> 02:07:29.710
I've never seen in the corner pool.

02:07:29.710 --> 02:07:31.800
And so like out of, you know,

